# A small chandelier as decoration (Stage 9, back layer, no k, no flat
# band): an o chain (10 px, rows 0-9), an O/o canopy, o/O stem, four
# S-curved O/o arms with w candles (c tips) on i cups, h/i crystal
# drops and an h/i crystal bowl. Frame 1 moves the w glint from a
# drop to the bowl. Place its bottom at row 8's bottom so the chain
# meets the cornice (row 6).
sprite = luster_deko
size   = 32x32
origin = 16,32
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=30 loop
